{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2021b.q31.material.recovered", "text": "李老师教《溪山行旅图》一课时，介绍了作品产生的时代背景，进入具体的赏析环节时，李老师用PPT展示作品全貌、津津有味地讲述了十分钟，有个学生举手发言：“老师画面中没有颜色，什么也看不懂，还不如看照片！”在面对这样的突发状况时李老师不知所措……", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "99b02648ec364347250824c27be56c07470c733bde294c41699c547976ea27e2", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1962, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2082, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "99b02648ec364347250824c27be56c07470c733bde294c41699c547976ea27e2"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2021b.q31"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.s4.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.manage"], "exam_requirement_ids": [], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2021b.q31"], "word_count": 120, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "meishu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "99b02648ec364347250824c27be56c07470c733bde294c41699c547976ea27e2", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1962, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2082, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "99b02648ec364347250824c27be56c07470c733bde294c41699c547976ea27e2"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization_status": "unkno