{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2021b.q32.material.recovered", "text": "《尝试抽象画》一课的练习环节中，王老师巡视学生创作情况，看到小明同学的画面效果比较好，就顺手添加了几笔，形式美感更强了，小明深受启发，又认真地丰富画面，效果更好了，可在展评环节，王老师让小明把画放在实物投影仪下进行了自评，有同学在互评时指出：“这是老师帮他画的。”小明反驳说：“是我自己画的！”眼看就要争吵起来……", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "99b02648ec364347250824c27be56c07470c733bde294c41699c547976ea27e2", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2130, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2287, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 32, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "99b02648ec364347250824c27be56c07470c733bde294c41699c547976ea27e2"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2021b.q32"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.s3.k03", "ntce.chuzhong.meishu.s4.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.manage"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.314.r020", "ntce.outline.314.r023"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2021b.q32"], "word_count": 157, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "meishu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "99b02648ec364347250824c27be56c07470c733bde294c41699c547976ea27e2", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2130, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2287, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 32, "alignment_status": "p